        "Description": "Your targets are as follows:\r\rZana Kazem: A freelance assassin and is also known to be a top assassin that worked for Crystal Dawn in the past as one of their agents.\r\rSheikh Omar Al-Ghazali: A member of the Al-Ghazali royal family, and the owner of the Burj Al-Ghazali. He previously met Carl Ingram who helped cover up his role in Providence.\r\rMukarram Soltani: The current personal bodyguard of Marcus Stuyvesant until the replacement guard assumes his position.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
